ource=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">24 seconds<br/><small>(2% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 14, 2004<br/>Christmas Update 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050713134555&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Cane_850370.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a candy cane.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Mmmm.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>During the Christmas event, you can get 10 candy canes as part of common presents from <a href=\"#/wiki/Santa%20Claus\">Santa Claus</a>, and you can also drop up to 3 candy canes from <a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblins</a> (rare loot). Additionally, between the <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Saves</a> of October 31 and November 3 (<a href=\"#/wiki/Halloween\">Halloween</a>), you can get 50 Candy Canes by skinning the corpse of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</a> with an <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a>.\n3 of them are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Blue Christmas Bundle</li><li>Candy Canes</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demonic%20Candy%20Ball\">Demonic Candy Ball</a></li><li>Event Creatures</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li>Green Christmas Bundle</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li><li>Guide:Moneymaking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Halloween\">Halloween</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a></li><li>Party Items</li><li>Red Christmas Bundle</li><li>Red Rose</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Santa%20Claus\">Santa Claus</a><